<p>Da muß dann &#x017F;eyn <hi rendition="#aq">2xx - x = yy</hi>, wo <hi rendition="#aq">a = 2</hi>,<lb/>
<hi rendition="#aq">b = - 1</hi>, und <hi rendition="#aq">c = 0</hi>; der bekante Fall i&#x017F;t hier offen-<lb/>
